            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Paul Panlilio"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love this dish specially when the spices are bumped up several notches. I changed a few ingredients: 1/2lb liver, 1lb lung, 1lb heart, 1lb spleen, 4bay leaves, 3 large onions finely chopped, 1 16oz can of stewed tomatoes, dash of parika, cayenne, and 2 jalapeno peppers.\nI boil the meats in water with salt, pepper and spring onions. (the water left from boiling the meat makes a good base for Demi-Glaze)."
